# ULDA Topological Decoder Engine & Sexagesimal Hardware Register

An implementation of the Register-Space Space-Time Engine under the Unified Lineage Data Architecture (ULDA). This architecture eliminates binary floating-point roundoff artifacts, radix-drift, and cumulative noise metrics in large-scale spacetime quantum topological simulations.

