Modern software engineering is trapped in a state of numerical truncation where pristine algebraic states are continuously degraded into endless, chaotic binary expansions (\(0.11001100\dots_2\)). This engine operates entirely on pure integer register spaces:

- **Zero Runtime Division:** Traditional division and modulo operations introduce massive propagation delay and warp divergence. This engine completely eliminates them at runtime, utilizing a hardwired Look-Up Logic Matrix (LUM) and native, high-speed logarithmic bit-shifting (`<<` and `>>`).
- **Minimal Memory Footprint:** Spacetime coordinate loops compress traditional float32/64 buffers into tight, single-word integer bitmasks.
- **The Structural Cipher (Omission of 6):** The number 6 is strictly isolated as a structural matrix operator (the register index) and omitted from sequential data loops. The pipeline jumps from 5 straight to 7 (1 → 2 → 3 → 4 → 5 → 7).

