## Verification & Build

### FPGA Synthesis Setup
To run physical implementation and execute technology mapping on Xilinx UltraScale+ hardware arrays, invoke Vivado via batch processing mode:

```bash
vivado -mode batch -source engine/synth.tcl
```

### Python Reference Verification
To evaluate bit-packed register transitions and verify zero-drift matrix state normalization routines, execute the reference file directly:

```bash
python ulda_register.py
```

